WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.169
Oh, got like a real
office up there.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.922
People typing and being
awkward at everything.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.924
It's so bananas, right.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:10.885
Oh and I found out why I got such 
a good deal on this place

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:13.805
Oh I love a bit of corporate
real estate scuttlebutt 

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:17.267
So the previous tennants,
they had to break the lease

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:19.978
because the boss kept getting
caught pinching his employee’s butts

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.187
all the time!

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.147
Well...

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:24.357
One man’s grape is another
woman’s gain.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:27.694
It does explain why my office
comes with fun features like this

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.361
look, watch.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.073
Yikes!

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:33.616
but also quite cool

